4... Nh5 $2 { Attacks the bishop, but the knight on b8 is still at home. White takes it first. } 5. Bxb8 Rxb8 6. Bb5+ { Check, and the bishop on b5 cannot be taken. } 6... Bd7 7. Bxd7+ Qxd7 8. Ne5 { Attacks the queen, and the knight on h5 is also loose to Qxh5, so Black cannot keep everything. } *
